弟怖懼，詣武昌降於陸遜，乞出平地，自改為善，由是數郡無復憂惕。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line088:m0165","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line088:m0100"}],"interpretation_note":"以此來源所述兩端為據。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"life_events":[{"id":"le-wu060-zhoufang1","person_id":"d2f_0dk_l4m","event_type":"death","source_term":"誘狙殺嗣","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-060","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line088","quote":"　　魴初建密計時，頻有郎官奉詔詰問諸事，魴乃詣部郡門下，因下發謝，故休聞之，不復疑慮。事捷軍旋，權大會諸將歡宴，酒酣。謂魴曰：“君下發載義，成孤大事，君之功名，當書之竹帛。”加裨將軍，賜爵關內侯。賊帥董嗣負阻劫鈔，豫章、臨川並受其害。吾粲、唐咨嘗以三千兵攻守，連月不能拔。魴表乞罷兵，得以便宜從事。魴遣間諜，授以方策，誘狙殺嗣。嗣弟怖懼，詣武昌降於陸遜，乞出平地，自改為善，由是數郡無復憂惕。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line088:m0100"}],"interpretation_note":"本來源所記。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line088:m0100","start":100,"end":102,"surface":"董嗣","kind":"person","person_id":"d2f_0dk_l4m","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line088","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line088:m0162","start":162,"end":163,"surface":"嗣","kind":"person","person_id":"d2f_0dk_l4m","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line088","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line088:m0164","start":164,"end":165,"surface":"嗣","kind":"person","person_id":"d2f_0dk_l4m","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sang